{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-07_beg","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-07","title":"폭군","storyCode":"1-7","avgTag":"작전 전","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2561c160c982ae1110452865ffa4574e140a91b02bfe546412b7d4ec0f2ac436","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"메딕 오퍼레이터를 구하기 위해 위험 속으로 몸을 던진 박사는, 다행히도 니어의 도움을 받게 된다.\n하지만 리유니온에겐 공격을 멈출 기미가 보이지 않는다……","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"충격에 대비하라!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"모두 흩어져!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"규모가 너무 커… 이대로는 이 구역에 있는 건물과 함께 먼지가 되고 말 거다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"도베르만","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"제길, 큰일이군!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"에이스","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"에이스","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"어서 퇴각하라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메딕 오퍼레이터","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"……!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"에이스","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"버텨라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"아…!! 떠, 떨어진다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"하늘이… 무너진다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"시, 싫어… 아파…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"손이, 손이! 내 손 어디로 간 거야…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"뭐, 뭐야! 뭐냐고!! 죽고 싶지 않아…!"},{"type":"di